  "answer": "Georgiana Tidman introduces herself as 'George Tidd,' her racing name, and tells Salome and Sheba to ask after George Tidd at Newmarket. She uses the nickname to assert her identity in the horse-racing world, and later, when she rallies her old racing acquaintances to rescue the Dean, they recognize her as 'George Tidd.'",
